{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StudioPalette",
  "$description": "The command palette: a `role=\"combobox\"` field over the kit's `jx-listbox`, whose rows are `jx-option`s the host projects. `rows` is the ranked set for the current mode and query; `activeId` is the highlight, and it is ONE string — the id the field points `aria-activedescendant` at and the id the listbox is handed as `active`, so a key moves the caret without the rows reconciling and no row re-decides its own flag. The FIELD is not a `jx-combobox`: this one carries a mode chip inside its box, its Enter runs a command rather than committing a value, and its panel is a centred scrim rather than a popover under a control. Every gesture calls back into panels/quick-search.ts, which owns the modes, the ranking, the recents and what a row does.",
  "tagName": "div",
  "attributes": {
    "part": "palette"
  },
  "style": {
    "display": "contents",
    "& [part=\"overlay\"]": {
      "position": "fixed",
      "inset": "0",
      "zIndex": "1000",
      "display": "flex",
      "justifyContent": "center",
      "paddingTop": "60px",
      "background": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4)"
    },
    "& [part=\"panel\"]": {
      "width": "560px",
      "maxWidth": "calc(100vw - 32px)",
      "maxHeight": "420px",
      "display": "flex",
      "flexDirection": "column",
      "alignSelf": "flex-start",
      "background": "var(--jx-bg-overlay)",
      "border": "1px solid var(--jx-border)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--jx-radius-md)",
      "boxShadow": "var(--jx-shadow-dialog)",
      "color": "var(--jx-fg)",
      "fontFamily": "var(--jx-font-sans)",
      "overflow": "hidden"
    },
    "& [part=\"input-row\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)",
      "paddingLeft": "var(--jx-space-4)",
      "background": "var(--jx-bg-input)",
      "borderBottom": "1px solid var(--jx-border)"
    },
    "& [part=\"chip-slot\"], & [part=\"empty-slot\"], & [part=\"section-slot\"], & [part=\"trailing-slot\"]": {
      "display": "contents"
    },
    "& [part=\"chip\"]": {
      "display": "inline-flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-1)",
      "flexShrink": "0",
      "padding": "2px var(--jx-space-1) 2px var(--jx-space-3)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--jx-radius-sm)",
      "background": "var(--jx-accent-solid)",
      "color": "var(--jx-accent-fg)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)"
    },
    "& [part=\"chip-remove\"] > [part=\"control\"]": {
      "color": "inherit",
      "opacity": "0.8",
      ":hover": {
        "opacity": "1",
        "background": "transparent"
      }
    },
    "& [part=\"input\"]": {
      "flex": "1",
      "minWidth": "0",
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-4) var(--jx-space-5) var(--jx-space-4) var(--jx-space-1)",
      "font": "inherit",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-lg)",
      "border": "none",
      "outline": "none",
      "background": "none",
      "color": "var(--jx-fg)",
      "::placeholder": {
        "color": "var(--jx-fg-muted)"
      },
      ":focus-visible": {
        "outline": "var(--jx-focus-ring)",
        "outlineOffset": "-2px"
      }
    },
    "& [part=\"results\"]": {
      "$description": "The list is the kit's: a `jx-listbox` of `jx-option`, so the highlight is ONE id — `active`, the same string the field points `aria-activedescendant` at — and the listbox's sidecar is the single writer of every row's `selected`. What this surface still decides is density. The kit's row pads itself by `--jx-space-3`; the other half of the 16px optical margin the panel has always had sits here, on the list, so the heading, the rows and the empty sentence line up on one edge instead of each naming it.",
      "flex": "1",
      "paddingInline": "var(--jx-space-3)"
    },
    "& [part=\"option\"] [part=\"label\"]": {
      "fontWeight": "500"
    },
    "& [part=\"option\"] [part=\"description\"]": {
      "$description": "A `jx-select` row's note is a category at the END of the row, so the kit pushes it there with an auto margin. A palette row's note is a CONTINUATION of its name — the file's directory, the command's category — and the far edge belongs to the chord, which is how this surface teaches the keyboard it replaced. So the auto margin moves to the end slot.",
      "marginInlineStart": "0"
    },
    "& [part=\"option\"] [part=\"end\"]": {
      "marginInlineStart": "auto"
    },
    "& [part=\"option\"][aria-disabled=\"true\"]": {
      "$description": "An unavailable command is greyed with its `requires` sentence as the subtitle, and that sentence is the reason the row is on screen at all. The kit fades the whole row to 0.45, which would take a muted grey below any readable contrast — so the row keeps its ink and only the name and the glyph dim.",
      "opacity": "1"
    },
    "& [part=\"option\"][aria-disabled=\"true\"] [part=\"label\"], & [part=\"option\"][aria-disabled=\"true\"] [part=\"icon\"]": {
      "opacity": "0.45"
    },
    "& [part=\"chord\"]": {
      "flexShrink": "0",
      "fontFamily": "inherit",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-xs)",
      "color": "var(--jx-fg-muted)",
      "border": "1px solid var(--jx-border)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--jx-radius-sm)",
      "padding": "0 5px"
    },
    "& [part=\"option\"][aria-selected=\"true\"] [part=\"chord\"]": {
      "color": "inherit",
      "borderColor": "currentColor"
    },
    "& [part=\"badge\"]": {
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-xs)",
      "padding": "1px var(--jx-space-2)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--jx-radius-sm)",
      "background": "var(--jx-border)",
      "color": "var(--jx-fg-dim)"
    },
    "& [part=\"hint\"]": {
      "padding": "var(--jx-space-2) var(--jx-space-5)",
      "borderTop": "1px solid var(--jx-border)",
      "color": "var(--jx-fg-muted)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-xs)"
    },
    "& [part=\"hint\"] kbd": {
      "fontFamily": "inherit",
      "color": "var(--jx-fg-dim)"
    }
  },
  "$switch": {
    "$ref": "#/state/open"
  },
  "cases": {
    "true": {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "part": "overlay"
      },
      "onclick": {
        "$prototype": "Function",
        "body": [
          {
            "operator": "call",
            "target": {
              "$ref": "#/state/close"
            },
            "value": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "div",
          "attributes": {
            "part": "panel"
          },
          "onclick": {
            "$prototype": "Function",
            "body": [
              {
                "stopPropagation": true
              }
            ]
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "input-row"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "span",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "chip-slot",
                    "role": "none"
                  },
                  "$switch": {
                    "$ref": "#/state/hasChip"
                  },
                  "cases": {
                    "true": {
                      "tagName": "span",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "chip"
                      },
                      "children": [
                        {
                          "tagName": "span",
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "chip-label"
                          },
                          "textContent": "${state.chipLabel}"
                        },
                        {
                          "tagName": "jx-action-button",
                          "$props": {
                            "label": "Clear mode",
                            "hint": "Clear mode (Backspace)",
                            "icon": "x",
                            "size": "sm"
                          },
                          "attributes": {
                            "part": "chip-remove"
                          },
                          "onclick": {
                            "$prototype": "Function",
                            "body": [
                              {
                                "operator": "call",
                                "target": {
                                  "$ref": "#/state/clearMode"
                                },
                                "value": []
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "input",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "input",
                    "type": "text",
                    "role": "combobox",
                    "aria-controls": "quick-search-listbox",
                    "aria-expanded": "${state.expanded ? 'true' : 'false'}",
                    "aria-activedescendant": "${state.activeId || null}",
                    "aria-autocomplete": "list",
                    "aria-label": "${state.placeholder}",
                    "placeholder": "${state.placeholder}"
                  },
                  "value": {
                    "$ref": "#/state/query"
                  },
                  "oninput": {
                    "$prototype": "Function",
                    "body": [
                      {
                        "operator": "call",
                        "target": {
                          "$ref": "#/state/input"
                        },
                        "value": [
                          {
                            "$ref": "event#/target/value"
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  "onkeydown": {
                    "$prototype": "Function",
                    "body": [
                      {
                        "$switch": {
                          "$ref": "event#/key"
                        },
                        "cases": {
                          "ArrowDown": [
                            {
                              "preventDefault": true
                            },
                            {
                              "operator": "call",
                              "target": {
                                "$ref": "#/state/move"
                              },
                              "value": [1]
                            }
                          ],
                          "ArrowUp": [
                            {
                              "preventDefault": true
                            },
                            {
                              "operator": "call",
                              "target": {
                                "$ref": "#/state/move"
                              },
                              "value": [-1]
                            }
                          ],
                          "Enter": [
                            {
                              "preventDefault": true
                            },
                            {
                              "operator": "call",
                              "target": {
                                "$ref": "#/state/activate"
                              },
                              "value": []
                            }
                          ],
                          "Escape": [
                            {
                              "preventDefault": true
                            },
                            {
                              "operator": "call",
                              "target": {
                                "$ref": "#/state/close"
                              },
                              "value": []
                            }
                          ],
                          "Backspace": [
                            {
                              "$switch": {
                                "$ref": "#/state/canClearMode"
                              },
                              "cases": {
                                "true": [
                                  {
                                    "preventDefault": true
                                  },
                                  {
                                    "operator": "call",
                                    "target": {
                                      "$ref": "#/state/clearMode"
                                    },
                                    "value": []
                                  }
                                ]
                              }
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tagName": "jx-listbox",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "results",
                "id": "quick-search-listbox"
              },
              "$props": {
                "label": "Results",
                "active": "${state.activeId}"
              },
              "onselect": {
                "$prototype": "Function",
                "body": [
                  {
                    "operator": "call",
                    "target": {
                      "$ref": "#/state/activateRow"
                    },
                    "value": [
                      {
                        "$ref": "event#/detail"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ],
                "description": "One handler for every row, because a row's `select` bubbles. The detail is the row's `value`, which is the index it occupies in `rows` — the same number a hover names, and the number the id is built from."
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "empty-slot",
                    "role": "none"
                  },
                  "$switch": {
                    "$ref": "#/state/isEmpty"
                  },
                  "cases": {
                    "true": {
                      "tagName": "div",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "empty"
                      },
                      "textContent": "${state.emptyHint}"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "tagName": "div",
                  "attributes": {
                    "part": "section-slot",
                    "role": "none"
                  },
                  "$switch": {
                    "$ref": "#/state/showSection"
                  },
                  "cases": {
                    "true": {
                      "tagName": "div",
                      "attributes": {
                        "part": "group-heading"
                      },
                      "textContent": "${state.sectionLabel}"
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "$prototype": "Array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/state/rows"
                  },
                  "key": {
                    "$ref": "$map/item/key"
                  },
                  "map": {
                    "tagName": "jx-option",
                    "attributes": {
                      "part": "option",
                      "id": "quick-search-option-${$map.index}",
                      "data-kind": "${$map.item.kind}"
                    },
                    "$props": {
                      "value": "${$map.index}",
                      "label": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/name"
                      },
                      "description": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/detail"
                      },
                      "disabled": {
                        "$ref": "$map/item/disabled"
                      }
                    },
                    "onmouseenter": {
                      "$prototype": "Function",
                      "body": [
                        {
                          "operator": "call",
                          "target": {
                            "$ref": "#/state/hover"
                          },
                          "value": [
                            {
                              "$ref": "$map/index"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "tagName": "jx-icon",
                        "attributes": {
                          "slot": "icon"
                        },
                        "$props": {
                          "name": {
                            "$ref": "$map/item/icon"
                          }
                        }
                      },
                      {
                        "tagName": "span",
                        "attributes": {
                          "slot": "end",
                          "part": "trailing-slot"
                        },
                        "$switch": {
                          "$ref": "$map/item/trailing"
                        },
                        "cases": {
                          "chord": {
                            "tagName": "kbd",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "chord"
                            },
                            "textContent": "${$map.item.chord}"
                          },
                          "recent": {
                            "tagName": "span",
                            "attributes": {
                              "part": "badge"
                            },
                            "textContent": "recent"
                          }
                        }
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "tagName": "div",
              "attributes": {
                "part": "hint"
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "tagName": "kbd",
                  "textContent": "↑↓"
                },
                " move · ",
                {
                  "tagName": "kbd",
                  "textContent": "↵"
                },
                " run · ",
                {
                  "tagName": "kbd",
                  "textContent": "?"
                },
                " modes · ",
                {
                  "tagName": "kbd",
                  "textContent": ">"
                },
                " commands · ",
                {
                  "tagName": "kbd",
                  "textContent": "@"
                },
                " elements"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
